      "message": "Yes your understanding is correct. The minimum # of reads was always 2. And it will continue to be, the reads are now just spaced out over 15ms instead of 1ms or whatever. The # of reads will be less than or equal to what it is now\n\nI don\u0027t think there is a way to avoid doing the 1 cycle unless we remove the SW deglitch. We need to wait at least 10ms between reads to make sure the alert is gone.",
